    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a \"truer story\"? that sounds like something from a self-help book. the reality is i'm just a shell. everyone looks at me and sees a failure. there's no \"new beginning\" when the foundation is completely rotted out. it's just exhausting, constantly trying to pretend there's a point to it all when there really isn't. sometimes i think it would be more honest to just stop pretending.",
